WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.020
Two brands.

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:03.680
The same eleven-out-of-twelve mentions.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:05.600
But who came first?

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.420
In Recoscope’s November twelfth
air purifier snapshot,

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:14.420
Coway and Levoit each appeared
in eleven of twelve usable answers,

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.780
across four AI assistants
and three prompt types.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.100
In the comparisons,

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.500
ChatGPT and Claude
ranked Levoit first.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.800
Gemini and Perplexity
ranked Coway first.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:29.580
Coway also made the top three
in all four comparisons.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.500
Levoit did in three.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.260
The lesson for brands:

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:36.820
visibility and first choice
are different measures.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:40.220
These findings describe
captured AI answers,

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.750
not product quality.

00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.100
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
